<span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">, </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">podepsaný </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">prezidentem </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Joem </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Bidenem </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">12. </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">května </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">2021. </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[1]</span></p><p class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">TVRZENÍ:</span></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">T1: </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">SBOM </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">znamená </span><span class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-font-style=\"italic\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Software </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Bill </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">of </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Materials</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">a </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">představuje </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">formální </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">záznam </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">o </