-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[1]</span></p><p class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">ZDROJE:</span></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">[1] </span><span class=\"TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-font-style=\"italic\" data-d-inline=\"\"><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Executive </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Order </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">14028 </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">of </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">May </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">12, </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">2021: </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Improving </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">the </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Nation’s </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Cybersecurity</span></span> <span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">– </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">The </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">White </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">House </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">/ </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Federal </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">Register </span><span data-d-text-flow=\"word\" data-d-stream-word=\"\">– </span><span data-d-text